    "怒りながら、ニクスは私を彼女のオフィスから押し出し、私の胸を叩きながら、背後でドアをバタンと閉めた。"

# game/data/world_romance/nyx/rom_nyx_scr.rpy:159
translate ja rom_nyx_start_74f67fe5:

    # MC "(Fuck ... Maybe I screwed that up?)"
    MC "(くそ…失敗したかも？)"

# game/data/world_romance/nyx/rom_nyx_scr.rpy:163
translate ja rom_nyx_start_30d8ecd2:

    # NYX @ sad "I-"
    NYX @ sad "私-"

# game/data/world_romance/nyx/rom_nyx_scr.rpy:164
translate ja rom_nyx_start_4ea96ec8:

    # NYX @ talk "Yes, exactly."
    NYX @ talk "ええ、その通り。"

# game/data/world_romance/nyx/rom_nyx_scr.rpy:165
translate ja rom_nyx_start_6643518e:

    # NYX @ talk "I am, um, glad that you're being so mature about this."
    NYX @ talk "あなたがこんなに大人びているのは、うん、嬉しいよ。"

# game/data/world_romance/nyx/rom_nyx_scr.rpy:167
translate ja rom_nyx_start_f958eb5c:

    # "There was a tinge of disappointment in Captain Nyx's voice that she masked with a smile."
    "ニックス艦長の声には、微笑で隠しながらも、かすかに失望の色がにじんでいた。"

# game/data/world_romance/nyx/rom_nyx_scr.rpy:169
translate ja rom_nyx_start_f09ddd1f:

    # NYX @ laugh "Yes, yes, it's for the best."
    NYX @ laugh "はい、はい、それが一番です。"

# game/data/world_romance/nyx/rom_nyx_scr.rpy:170
translate ja rom_nyx_start_6c943a16:

    # NYX @ laugh "I will contact you when I'm need of your services again."
    NYX @ laugh "再びご用命の際はご連絡いたします。"

# game/data/world_romance/nyx/rom_nyx_scr.rpy:171
translate ja rom_nyx_start_26e15216:

    # "Captain Nyx stepped forward, gently pushing me towards the door."
    "キャプテン・ニックスが前に進み出て、優しく私をドアの方へ押しながら。"

# game/data/world_romance/nyx/rom_nyx_scr.rpy:172
translate ja rom_nyx_start_d6b7415f:

    # NYX @ laugh "Now if you don't mind, I have plenty of work to be getting back to!"
    NYX @ laugh "さて、差し支えなければ、仕事が山ほど残っていますので!"

# game/data/world_romance/nyx/rom_nyx_scr.rpy:173
translate ja rom_nyx_start_beeb188a:

    # "Nyx gently pushed me outside of her office."
    "ニクスは私を彼女のオフィスの外へそっと押し出した。"

# game/data/world_romance/nyx/rom_nyx_scr.rpy:174
translate ja rom_nyx_start_144aa833:

    # MC @ talk "Very well, {i}Nyx.{/i}"
    MC @ talk "わかりました、{i}Nyx{/i}。"

# game/data/world_romance/nyx/rom_nyx_scr.rpy:175
translate ja rom_nyx_start_95029057:

    # NYX @ laugh "That's {i}Captain{/i} Nyx to you."
    NYX @ laugh "こちらに向かっては{i}艦長{/i}と呼びなさい。"

# game/data/world_romance/nyx/rom_nyx_scr.rpy:176
translate ja rom_nyx_start_cdae3050:

    # "Captain Nyx slammed the doors shut behind me."
    "ニックス艦長が私の後ろでドアをバタンと閉めた。"

# game/data/world_romance/nyx/rom_nyx_scr.rpy:178
translate ja rom_nyx_start_154fa55d:

    # NYX @ sad "...{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    NYX @ sad "…{i}はあ…{/i}"

# game/data/world_romance/nyx/rom_nyx_scr.rpy:179
translate ja rom_nyx_start_0c8ef2bc:

    # NYX "(It's for the best.)"
    NYX "(これで良かったのだ。)"

# game/data/world_romance/nyx/rom_nyx_scr.rpy:186
translate ja rom_nyx_start_2b41bb43:

    # MC "(I wonder what would have happened if I pushed her a little more back there?)"
    MC "(あの時、もう少し責めていたらどうなっていただろうか？)"

